Vnum            10212
Name            裂界核心臺~
Description
核心臺幾乎懸在空中，四周封圈只剩殘片。腳下傳來深井脈動，沿井壁已可辨認出通往下層的承臺微光。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        10211
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        10301
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         深層~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         核心~
End

End
